506","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：《会稽典录》称其字周林","evidence":["wufan-q-8b32491cfe7278c85f28"]},{"id":"wufan-m-f71b6c9b64cb2cbad96d","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：《会稽典录》称其祖父河内太守朗，字少英，列在‘八俊’","evidence":["wufan-q-9854c77526abeb7a27a1"]},{"id":"wufan-m-2dc1dd335c471ae05d2e","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：《会稽典录》称其性刚直，行不苟合；虽遭困逼，终不回挠","evidence":["wufan-q-2fdd92cdddddc571d4f9"]},{"id":"wufan-m-3a699a8ac082ad2ca884","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：《会稽典录》称其历历（山）〔阳〕、（潘）〔鄱〕阳、山阴三县令，鄱阳太守","evidence":["wufan-q-dbf93a28ffbf3a875080"]}],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-f06a2a52451458ce7162","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-080517cf7c2fb59c8f80","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《会稽典录》曰：“策功曹魏（腾）〔滕〕，以迕意见谴，将杀之；士大夫忧恐，计无所出。夫人乃倚大井，而谓策曰：‘汝新造江南，其事未集；方当优贤礼士，舍过录功。魏功曹，在公尽规；汝今日杀之，则明日人皆叛汝。吾不忍见祸之及，当先投此井中耳！’策大惊，遽释（腾）〔滕〕。夫人智略权谲，类皆如此。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6a1592dc85eae5334353","start":0,"end":146,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wufan-q-2fdd92cdddddc571d4f9","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-10857288d302bde370ae","layer":"pei","quote":"滕性刚直，行不苟合；虽遭困逼，终不回挠","attribution":"裴注所引记载（引书见原文）","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-12d93e9e230aa0662150","start":36,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wufan-q-44ded950143707992ec8","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-10857288d302bde370ae","layer":"pei","quote":"初亦忤策，几殆，赖太妃救得免","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-12d93e9e230aa0662150","start":56,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},